{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s15BitwiseCopyableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s12CaseIterableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/Se","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SE","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SQ","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SH","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"FoundationEssentials","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials16AttributedStringV16WritingDirectionO","symbolKind":"enum","roleHeading":"Enumeration","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"title":"AttributedString.WritingDirection","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WritingDirection","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WritingDirection","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/attributedstring\/writingdirection"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/init(from:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The writing direction of a piece of text."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/AttributeInvalidationCondition","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF16View","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF8View","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/AttributeRunBoundaries"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Supporting-types","title":"Supporting types"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WritingDirection"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing direction defines the base direction in which bidirectional text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lays out its directional runs. A directional run is a contiguous sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of characters that all have the same effective directionality, which can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be determined using the Unicode BiDi algorithm. The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writing direction puts the directional run that is placed first in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"storage leftmost, and places subsequent directional runs towards the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right. The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" writing direction puts the directional run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that is placed first in the storage rightmost, and places subsequent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directional runs towards the left."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that writing direction is a property separate from a text’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alignment, its line layout direction, or its character direction."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, it is often used to determine the default alignment of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paragraph. E.g. English (a language with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/leftToRight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/characterDirection"},{"type":"text","text":") is usually aligned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the left, but may be centered or aligned to the right for special"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effect, or to be visually more appealing in a user interface."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For bidirectional text to be perceived as laid out correctly, make sure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the writing direction is set to the value equivalent to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/characterDirection"},{"type":"text","text":" of the primary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language in the text. E.g. an English sentence that contains some"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Arabic (a language with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/rightToLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/characterDirection"},{"type":"text","text":") words, should use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight"},{"type":"text","text":" writing direction. An Arabic sentence that contains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"some English words, should use a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" writing direction."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing direction is always orthogonoal to the line layout direction"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chosen to display a certain text. The line layout direction is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"direction in which a sequence of lines is placed in. E.g. English text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is usually displayed with a line layout direction of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/topToBottom"},{"type":"text","text":". While languages do"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have an associated line language direction (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Locale\/Language-swift.struct\/lineLayoutDirection"},{"type":"text","text":"), not all displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of text follow the line layout direction of the text’s primary language."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Horizontal script is script with a line layout direction of either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/topToBottom"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/bottomToTop"},{"type":"text","text":". Vertical script"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/leftToRight"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Locale\/LanguageDirection\/rightToLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" line layout"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"direction. In vertical scripts, a writing direction of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/leftToRight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is interpreted as top-to-bottom and a writing direction of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/WritingDirection\/rightToLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" is interpreted as bottom-to-top."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/s12CaseIterableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s12CaseIterableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.CaseIterable"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/AttributedString/UTF8View":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A view of an attributed string’s contents as a collection of UTF-8 code units."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UTF8View"}],"role":"symbol","title":"AttributedString.UTF8View","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/AttributedString\/UTF8View","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UTF8View"}],"url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/attributedstring\/utf8view"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/SE":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/SE","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Encodable"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/s15BitwiseCopyableP":{"title":"Swift.BitwiseCopyable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/s15BitwiseCopyableP"},"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/Locale/LanguageDirection/leftToRight":{"url":"\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/locale\/languagedirection\/lefttoright","title":"Locale.LanguageD